Pagkatapos nito, idagdag ito:

$resolved_reference = 'RES-' . date('YmdHis');

Hanapin ito
$update = $conn->prepare("
    UPDATE lost_found
    SET is_resolved = 1
    WHERE id IN (?, ?)
");

